-- 0286 — Protocol seeds (prescribing kit P5, F9): the named numbers of four protocols into their
-- seed versions' `seed`: severe malaria IV artesunate (FEATURES.md §2.6), status epilepticus (§2.7),
-- organophosphate poisoning (§2.8) and paracetamol overdose acetylcysteine 21 h (§2.9). Read by the
-- rule modules lib/protocols/rules/{art,se,op,nac}.ts (zod-checked: a version without them is shown
-- blocked). Values §2 does not give are the prototype's (`PC.<id>.build`); the reference ranges are
-- the prototype's REFS, with the DKA-only reason lines left empty.
--
-- GATED: owner-applied (`npm run db:migrate`), after 0282 and 0283. Still DRAFT and unsigned: 0282's
-- trigger allows the change, and nothing starts from them in production until two consultants sign
-- (P1). Each UPDATE touches only the untouched seed version (seed still '{}'), so it is re-runnable
-- and never changes a hospital's own copy or a signed one. Reverse: set the four seeds back to '{}'.

-- ─── art (§2.6) ───
